    "kind": "struct",
    "signature": "struct HashJoinBuffering",
    "docs": "Looks for all the [HashJoinExec]s in the plan and places a [BufferExec] node with the\nconfigured capacity in the probe side:\n\n```text\n           ┌───────────────────┐\n           │   HashJoinExec    │\n           └─────▲────────▲────┘\n         ┌───────┘        └─────────┐\n         │                          │\n┌────────────────┐         ┌─────────────────┐\n│   Build side   │       + │   BufferExec    │\n└────────────────┘         └────────▲────────┘\n                                    │\n                           ┌────────┴────────┐\n                           │   Probe side    │\n                           └─────────────────┘\n```\n\nWhich allows eagerly pulling it even before the build side has completely finished.",
